# Nougat extraction stub — arXiv:2204.00340

**Status:** stub only (backfill 2026-07-06). The original replication used
`paper/2204.00340.txt` (pdftotext dump) as its working extraction, not a
nougat `.mmd` rerender, because the qudit-QAOA replication is driven by
equations and section-IV numerical claims that pdftotext preserved
adequately.

**If a full nougat.mmd is required later:** run

```
nougat paper/2204.00340.pdf -o extraction/ --markdown
```

on any host with the nougat env available (e.g. uicgpu A100 idle slot,
per Rick's small-batch OCR rule). That will produce `extraction/2204.00340.mmd`.

**Extraction fields covered by the pdftotext dump used for this replication:**
- Section IV case study (max-3-coloring, penalty λ=20, N∈{4..9}, p∈{1..8}).
- Fig. 4 caption (peak-sharpening in ground-state amplitude vs p).
- Fig. 5 caption (optimality-gap monotone decrease with p; L-BFGS vs CMA-ES spread).
- Cost/mixer Hamiltonian definitions (L_z / L_x and Z_d / X_d shift).
- Table I of constraint-embedding methods (penalty / ancilla / DD).

None of the numerical claim extraction depended on a `.mmd` rerender.
